# Calliope stable AUR package — STUB.
#
# This file is a documentation-only stub. The stable channel package will
# pin to tagged releases once v1.0 (or first stable tag) is cut on this repo.
#
# When that happens, this file becomes a near-clone of the sibling
# `PKGBUILD` with the following differences:
#
#   pkgname=calliope                  # not "-git"
#   pkgver=$_release_tag              # e.g. 1.0.0
#   makedepends=()                    # no git build dependency
#   source=("$url/archive/v$pkgver.tar.gz")
#   sha256sums=('<computed at release time>')
#   # No pkgver() function — version is fixed to the tarball.
#   # `provides` and `conflicts` swap so that -git supersedes stable when
#   # both are installed simultaneously by mistake.
#   # Retain `provides=("dictation-server")` + matching `conflicts` for
#   # backward-compat with the old AUR namespace.
#
# Until v1.0 ships, the canonical path is `PKGBUILD` (-git). Stable users
# should be redirected there with a README note in the AUR submission.
#
# References:
#   - PKGBUILD (this directory) — the live -git definition
